<h1>Compare runs</h1><table><tr><th>Run</th><th>State</th><th>Step</th><th>Latest metrics</th><th>Benchmarks</th><th>Trainer time</th></tr><tr><td>a/same</td><td>running</td><td>2</td><td>loss: 1</td><td>latency: 1 ms</td><td>20s (last logged)</td></tr><tr><td>b/same</td><td>running</td><td>2</td><td>loss: 2</td><td>latency: 2 ms</td><td>20s (last logged)</td></tr></table><div class="actions"><a href="#benchmarks">Benchmarks</a><a href="#comparison-metadata">Metadata differences</a></div><details><summary>Chart options · loss · step</summary><form class="filters"><input type="hidden" name="run" value="a/same"><input type="hidden" name="run" value="b/same"><fieldset><legend>Chart</legend><label>Metric <input name="metric" list="metrics" value="loss"></label><datalist id="metrics"><option value="custom"></option><option value="loss"></option></datalist><label>Axis <select name="axis"><option value="step">step</option><option value="seconds">seconds</option><option value="time">time</option></select></label><label>Smoothing window <input type="number" name="smooth" min="1" max="100" value="1"></label><label>Seed groups <input type="checkbox" name="group" value="1" checked=""></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Visible range</legend><label>From <input type="number" step="any" name="start" value=""></label><label>To <input type="number" step="any" name="end" value=""></label><button>Apply</button></fieldset><p class="dim">Blank metric shows all curves. Smoothing is a trailing mean; 1 shows raw values. Axes use logged fields.</p></form></details><figure data-key="loss%7Ca%2Fsame%7Cb%2Fsame"><figcaption>loss <span class="dim">· 1 to 4</span></figcaption><div class="legend"><span style="color:hsl(79,65%,36%)">a/same: 1</span><span style="color:hsl(80,65%,36%)">b/same: 2</span></div><svg class="chart" role="img" width="900" height="180" style="aspect-ratio:5/1;height:auto" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-label="loss" viewBox="0 0 900 180" data-low="1" data-high="2"><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(79,65%,36%)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,180.00 900.00,180.00 "></polyline><polyline fill="none" stroke="hsl(80,65%,36%)" stroke-width="1.5" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" points="0.00,0.00 0.00,0.00 900.00,120.00 900.00,120.00 "></polyline></svg><div class="actions"><span class="dim">x: 1 to 2 · wheel to zoom, drag to pan</span><button type="button" data-reset="">Reset zoom</button></div><output></output></figure><table><tr><th>Seed group</th><th>Distinct seeds</th><th>Last shared x</th><th>Mean</th><th>Sample standard deviation</th><th>Standard error</th></tr></table><p>Aggregation uses distinct declared seeds at exactly shared x values; standard error assumes independent seeds.</p><details id="comparison-metadata"><summary>Metadata differences</summary><table><tr><th>Metadata</th><th>a/same</th><th>b/same</th></tr><tr><td>dataset</td><td>"demo"</td><td>"demo"</td></tr><tr><td>group</td><td>"trial"</td><td>"trial"</td></tr><tr><td>parameters.lr</td><td>0.01</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>revision</td><td>"abc"</td><td>"abc"</td></tr><tr><td>secret</td><td>"private-metadata"</td><td>"private-metadata"</td></tr><tr><td>seed</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>tags.0</td><td>"pilot"</td><td>"pilot"</td></tr><tr><td>task_id</td><td>7</td><td>7</td></tr></table></details><h2 id="benchmarks">Benchmark summary</h2><table><tr><th>Metric / unit</th><th>a/same</th><th>b/same</th></tr><tr><td>latency (ms, lower)</td><td class="">1 (Δ 0) </td><td class="warn">2 (Δ 1) </td></tr></table><div class="actions"><a href="/export?run=a%2Fsame&amp;run=b%2Fsame&amp;metric=loss&amp;group=1">Download CSV</a><a href="/report?run=a%2Fsame&amp;run=b%2Fsame&amp;metric=loss&amp;group=1">Download static report</a></div>
